'''Shuran''' (born '''Shuran Nabijanc'''; DAY MONTH {{abbr|2368|1967 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}) is a member of the [[Qymish royal family]] and served as [[Queen consort of Qym]] from {{abbr|2441|2027.8 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} to {{abbr|2443|2029.47 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} as the wife of [[Bacha XX of Qym|King Bacha XX]], the younger brother of [[Bacha XVIII of Qym|King Bacha XVIII]] and uncle of [[Bacha XIX of Qym|King Bacha XIX]]. Her son, [[Qodzar of Qym|Qodzar]], succeeded her husband as [[King of Qym]]. 

