Shuran is married to [[Bacha XX of Qym|King Bacha XX]] and they have three children, [[Princess Myril of Qym|Princess Myril]], [[Qodzar of Qym|King Qodzar]] and [[Princess Tëdozha of Qym|Princess Tëdozha]]. 

